Apple released the first betas of <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-27/">iOS 27</a>, iPadOS 27, and <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macos-27/">macOS 27</a> today, introducing a more capable version of <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/">Siri</a> called &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; AI. Developers are able to download the betas and try &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; out, but there is a waitlist.<br/>
